whisper-vocab.bin: the 50256 text tokens of OpenAI Whisper's multilingual tokenizer
(the vocabulary every multilingual whisper.cpp ggml model embeds), extracted by
tools/whisper-tokens/build-vocab.py and re-encoded (length-prefixed bytes, token-id order).
Used only to count prompt tokens on this device; nothing is sent.

Source: https://github.com/openai/whisper (whisper/assets/multilingual.tiktoken)

